0a01ccef5e0a7f94affb0376.webp?t=1738539085\" /></div> Deepen the mutual bond by helping them with their troubles. Or don't, and tell them they look ugly instead - we won't judge! (but villagers may)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881940/extras/e2836d7859c5a420e013e4052a3a87ca.avif?t=1738539085\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881940/extras/9a6de95cf9f585d041474edd00c5c1d8.poster.avif?t=1738539085\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881940/extras/9a6de95cf9f585d041474edd00c5c1d8.webm?t=1738539085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881940/extras/9a6de95cf9f585d041474edd00c5c1d8.mp4?t=1738539085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881940/extras/e3d3351fb0f8de622cbc5b6a6b41e04e.webp?t=1738539085\" /></div>\u00a0Cooperate with your townsfolk as they help construct new buildings or trade with them to get the items you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881940/extras/41007f514b8376bc9d288674be3ba93d.webp?t=1738539085\" /></div> Watch villagers specialise into different skilled crafts like carpentry or horticulture. Unlock your society's potential by making sure they have all the tools they need to prosper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881940/extras/e0249c8cc27ff0ebc08f3863d760bbcd.webp?t=1738539085\" /></div> When your collective skills don't cut it, merchants and markets can assist you by bringing what you need - at a price. Be careful not to blow your savings on luxurious goods!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881940/extras/7e8b1494106fea6a9d4686eb5302087a.webp?t=1738539085\" /></div>\u00a0Just like you, villagers can talk to each other, build their own relationships (or start their own beef), and make their own exchanges. As they pass on information, they form an emergent interconnected team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881940/extras/03db86bb5a7a3f3b2c570d51430fc1dd.avif?t=1738539085\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881940/extras/17795224e695c83794964e1db37aa6de.poster.avif?t=1738539085\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881940/extras/17795224e695c83794964e1db37aa6de.webm?t=1738539085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881940/extras/17795224e695c83794964e1db37aa6de.mp4?t=1738539085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881940/extras/ea1068b7bf37aef7e888341a065c65f7.webp?t=1738539085\" /></div>\u00a0Each map is randomly generated making every playthrough even more unique. Whether you want to build in a valley or a flatland, in a forest or the mountains, the choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881940/extras/192391dcad3ac98feadd8e1948317eb9.webp?t=1738539085\" /></div>\u00a0Find cute, scottish-highland inspired cows loitering around different corners and draw them into your barns to tame them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881940/extras/5f3b8cd370e055a7fb53d16a52bbb4ce.webp?t=1738539085\" /></div>\u00a0World details are also unique to each world, with each having its own regions, towns, family histories. Perhaps you\u2019ll find your rival's sibling joining you as you expand the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881940/extras/aae6a68e8b7c36e6c2ec1a3466b145fd.webp?t=1738539085\" /></div>\u00a0As time passes, the sun will rise, the stars will show, and the seasons will change. Witness colours and atmosphere shift around you as spring gradually gives way to winter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881940/extras/1f13bf60abe5a7b5a65b89acbd6b201a.avif?t=1738539085\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881940/extras/7f903d313aff2af61fa9ed9bf91f93ad.poster.avif?t=1738539085\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881940/extras/7f903d313aff2af61fa9ed9bf91f93ad.webm?t=1738539085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1881940/extras/7f903d313aff2af61fa9ed9bf91f93ad.mp4?t=1738539085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep warm with a fireplace during winter, or find a colourful place to frolic amidst long grass and arrays of countless flowers during summer. This game is designed to be cosy and stress-free; there are no timed tasks, no harsh penalties, and no combat putting your town at risk. You can challenge yourself to grow a huge town, or play at your own pace and stick to a small cottagecore village, with a few friendly faces.</p>",
    "short_description": "Forge a medieval community with intelligent AI villagers. Gather resources and transform the village into a town, or simply listen to captivating stories from various simulated and evolving lives. All in a beautiful, relaxing, and immersive fantasy world.",
